{"sha": "113e01daa8ba6bf11c90837f75fbe9a93a8c11d736103bbf7588dffdb5a9738e", "body": ["\\begin{remark}", "$\\E(X)$ 即为该实验大量独立重复时所得平均数的理论值，这一结论的精确", "表述是大数定律（证明见\\cref{ch:g12:sums}）。注意", "它与带频数的数据集平均数（见\\cref{def:g11:stat:mean}）在形式上的类比：", "概率在其中扮演的角色，", "恰如相对频数", "$\\frac{n_i}{n}$ 所扮演的角色。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:prob:gameexp}", "对于\\cref{ex:g11:prob:game}中的游戏：", "\\[", "\\E(G) = \\frac46 \\times (-2) + \\frac16 \\times 3 + \\frac16 \\times 4", "= \\frac{-8 + 3 + 4}{6} = -\\frac16 \\approx -0.17 .", "\\]", "平均而言，玩家每局约输 $17$ 分，该游戏对玩家", "不利。当期望收益为 $0$ 时，称该游戏为\\emph{公平}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[线性性]\\label{prop:g11:prob:linearity}", "对所有实数 $a, b$：", "\\[", "\\E(aX + b) = a\\,\\E(X) + b .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "变量 $aX + b$ 取值 $a x_i + b$ 的概率为", "$\\P(X = x_i)$，于是", "\\[", "\\E(aX + b) = \\sum_i \\P(X = x_i)(a x_i + b)", "= a \\sum_i \\P(X = x_i)\\,x_i + b \\underbrace{\\sum_i \\P(X =", "x_i)}_{=\\,1} = a\\,\\E(X) + b .", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "=\\section{方差与标准差}", "", "=\\begin{definition}[方差]\\label{def:g11:prob:variance}", "$X$ 的\\emph{方差}\\index{方差}刻画其取值", "围绕期望 $m = \\E(X)$ 的分散程度：", "\\[", "\\V(X) = \\E\\bigl((X - m)^2\\bigr)", "= \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\P(X = x_i)\\,(x_i - m)^2,", "\\qquad", "\\sigma(X) = \\sqrt{\\V(X)} .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[简便公式]\\label{prop:g11:prob:konig}", "\\[", "\\V(X) = \\E(X^2) - \\E(X)^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在求和号内将 $(x_i - m)^2 = x_i^2 - 2m\\,x_i + m^2$ 展开：", "\\[", "\\V(X) = \\sum_i \\P(X = x_i)\\,x_i^2", "- 2m \\sum_i \\P(X = x_i)\\,x_i + m^2\\sum_i \\P(X = x_i)", "= \\E(X^2) - 2m^2 + m^2 ,", "\\]", "即 $\\E(X^2) - m^2$。这是", "\\cref{prop:g11:stat:shortcut}中为数据集所证恒等式的随机变量版本。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[仿射变换]\\label{prop:g11:prob:affine}", "$\\V(aX + b) = a^2\\,\\V(X)$ 且 $\\sigma(aX + b) = \\abs a\\,\\sigma(X)$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由线性性，$aX + b$ 偏离其期望 $a m + b$ 的量为", "$(aX + b) - (am + b) = a(X - m)$：每个偏差都被 $a$ 放大，", "故每个偏差平方都放大 $a^2$ 倍，其加权平均亦然。", "注意常数 $b$ 已消失，平移一个随机变量", "并不改变其分散程度。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:prob:variance}", "对于\\cref{ex:g11:prob:game}中的游戏：", "$\\E(G^2) = \\frac46 \\times 4 + \\frac16 \\times 9 + \\frac16 \\times 16", "= \\frac{16 + 9 + 16}{6} = \\frac{41}{6}$，于是", "\\[", "\\V(G) = \\frac{41}{6} - \\left(-\\frac16\\right)^2", "= \\frac{41}{6} - \\frac{1}{36} = \\frac{245}{36} \\approx 6.8,", "\\qquad", "\\sigma(G) \\approx 2.6 .", "\\]", "平均每局的损失为 $0.17$，伴随的典型波动幅度约为", "$2.6$ 欧元——仅有期望而无标准差，", "只能讲出故事的一半。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=8.6cm, height=5.2cm,", "  ybar, bar width=14pt,", "  xlabel={$g$}, ylabel={$\\P(G = g)$},", "  xmin=-3.5, xmax=5.5, ymin=0, ymax=0.8,", "  xtick={-2,3,4}, ytick={1/6, 4/6},", "  yticklabels={$\\tfrac16$,$\\tfrac46$},", "  tick label style={font=\\small},", "  label style={font=\\small}]", "  \\addplot[fill=omDef!40, draw=omDef] coordinates {", "    (-2,0.6667) (3,0.1667) (4,0.1667)};", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed, thick] (axis cs:-0.1667,0) --", "    (axis cs:-0.1667,0.75);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:-0.05,0.62)", "    {$\\E(G)$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}